  "description": "Mid Drive Fat Bike - Fat Tire Power\nDJ Mid Drive Fat Bike, the most powerful fat tire electric bike from DJ Bikes Canada, is well built for fun and adventure. The powerful Bafang 48V 750W mid-drive motor located in the middle of the frame truly delivers power to the pedals for more stability and efficiency. 26\" puncture resistant fat tires, a preload adjustment suspension fork to absorb shock and 5 levels of pedal assist or full power will take you more places in more seasons. If you want to cruise down the beach, power up the hills or just enjoy a smooth ride around town, this electric mid drive fat bike is for you.\nThere's more to love about this fat tire mid drive electric bike from DJ Bikes Canada. The powerful 48V LG battery can be dismounted and charged anywhere on the go and even has a USB port for your Smart phone! The charger has a safety design to prevent over-charging.\nWhy buy a Mid Drive Electric Bike, and why is it more expensive?\n\nMid drive motors offer an enhanced gear ratio. They allow the rider to power the rear wheel via the same chain and gear set as the pedals\nA mid drive electric bike performs more efficiently on hills, because the bike can climb at low speeds\nDue to their centered position on the ebike, mid drives offer a more stable ride\nIt is easier to change tires on a mid drive fat bike, as there is no wiring between the hub and the frame\n\nThe DJ Mid Drive Fat Bike is powerful, affordable and durable, and built with high quality components – the best value for a 750W mid drive fat tire bike.",
